   "id": "klang-2-131563@post-2021-11-01",
   "gameId": "klang-2-131563",
   "displayName": "Fixed a bug where dying at the very end of a level could crash the game.",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2021-11-01T12:13:44.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Dying on the last couple of beats on a track could cause a very uncomfortable surge of very loud noise before crashing. This has now been fixed.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I must express my gratitude to the discord community, which not only found the bug but documented it in great detail as well.",
